              "030": "other programmes – of which 2-year programmes (41–80 weeks)",
              "040": "other programmes – of which 3-year programmes (81–120 weeks)"
            },
            "note": {
              "010": [
                "Programmes regulated under Section 8 of the Support for Fine Arts and Cultural Programmes and Certain Other Programmes Ordinance (2013:871) are defined as short programmes. These programmes can span everything from a day or so to 30 weeks of full-time studies in programme length."
              ]
